  step,dige:05436eaa123aec1d
  step=2,desc:stand two joined tanks that differ only in how their fish synapse sums — and wake one clock pulse,dige:0adb6cd53269bb98
  step=3,desc:3 clock pulses wait on each tank,dige:0f146cec1a7e965b
    Assertion:clock-pulses-wait-on,sentence:clock pulses wait on the synapse until the tank is woken — they turn nothing by themselves
  step=4,desc:wake both tanks,dige:bccbde6fad85dabe
    Assertion:three-clock-pulses-woken,sentence:three clock pulses woken together make three turns — a synapse summed by count runs once per pulse
    Assertion:a-turn-that-changes,sentence:a turn that changes the fish sends a pulse — it lands on the fish synapse at the boundary and waits for the next move
  step=5,desc:18 more clock pulses — and wake both tanks,dige:b2bd5279cea78d79
  step=6,desc:wake both tanks,dige:8c84162df22626c7
    Assertion:pulses-piled-up-on,sentence:pulses piled up on the fish synapse wake a heron summed to the latest once — and one summed by count once per pulse
